rows.abstract:
Provides for the following salient features of the measure:
a)	New, streamlined, and restructured Commission which shall be tasked to be a repository of all pertinent records of foreign nationals;
b)	Vests to the proposed Commission the authority to act on applications for administrative naturalization;
c)	Provides for a more extensive list of ineligible classes of aliens;
d)	Includes more visa categories and immigration privileges for foreign investors to attract more investments; 
e)	Establishes guidelines in dealing with refugees, stateless persons, and asylees, consistent with the developments in international law; and
f)	Imposes stiffer penalties for the crime of trafficking of persons.
